 as they can i know you you've  told our producers that  they aren't afraid  no they're not afraid so when they see a  border agency  and what did they when they would see a  border agent when trump was  president what would they do compared to  what they do now  um when they saw a border agent before  they stopped and they waited  and now they keep trying to go  and do the border agents let them go  no no they catch them when they see them  that's the big problem is when they get  up to my house  essentially they're almost they're  already on american soil and so they're  they're allowed to stay under this  administration  uh last question what's your what's your  biggest concern here  um now that the border policy has  changed what's going to happen now  is what is he going to do with um  stopping asylum seekers i just feel sad  for the people who  are trying to come in legally and they  can't because of all these asylum  seekers  thank you so much for being on with us  stay safe amanda we wish you all the  best thank you
 

